<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Caima has 0.12 bln esc '96 loss.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Caima has 0.12 bln esc '96 loss.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31 1996:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net 0.121 loss vs 3.171 profit</p>
<p>Operating result 0.536 loss vs 2.845 profit</p>
<p>Financial result 0.096 vs 0.047</p>
<p>Turnover 5.738 vs 9.213</p>
<p>Extraordinary profit 0.319 vs 0.279</p>
<p>Note - Pulp company Celulose Caima said it would propose the distribution of a dividend of 50 escudos per share for 1996, compared with 49.50 per share for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
